    <div class="hostel-section">
        <h1>Hostel</h1>
        <p>The St. Wilfred's PG College provides hostel facility as well. Hostel Rooms are comfortably furnished and make for a good home away from home. Girls and boys have separate hostels and each hostel has a fixed capacity. There is a range of accommodation and options to choose from for student’s convenience. In this kind of accommodation, students have access to a TV room, Aqua guard for hot and cold and normal drinking water and other leisure/ sport activities within the hostel premises. Also includes these facilities:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Spacious rooms allotted on twin sharing basis furnished with Two beds, Study table, Two chairs and Wardrobes.</li>
            <li>TV/Music Room There is a cozy TV/Music room in the hostel to unwind after a hectic day in the college including Indoor games.</li>
            <li>Common Room / Study Room / Library The hostels have a huge multi-purpose common room which is used for interactive session. This hall/room doubles up as the study room where students study together in large group. There is a library corner in this room which is very useful to the students.</li>
            <li>Visitor Room where the students meet their visitors.</li>
            <li>A huge courtyard & central lawn is a popular place for the students to relax.</li>
            <li>In girls hostel there is an in-house nurse provided to take care of the girls.</li>
            <li>Wi-Fi connectivity provided in all hostels</li>
